Your Deployment Flow (React + Django + MongoDB)

    1️⃣ Server Setup

    Create VPS in DigitalOcean
    → SSH → basic security → install packages

    2️⃣ Backend Setup (Django)

    Clone project
    Create venv
    Install requirements
    Configure env variables
    Connect to MongoDB Atlas

    3️⃣ Test Django

    Run:

    python manage.py runserver 0.0.0.0:8000

    If this fails → stop. Fix here.

    4️⃣ Gunicorn Setup

    Use Gunicorn
    → Run Django in production mode
    → Create system service

    5️⃣ Nginx Setup

    Use Nginx
    → Reverse proxy → route traffic to Gunicorn
    → Serve static files

    6️⃣ Frontend (React)

    Choose ONE:

    Build → serve via Nginx
    or
    Deploy separately (Vercel)
    
    7️⃣ Domain + HTTPS
    Point domain → server IP
    Install SSL (HTTPS)